          "Text": "Perth names: \u0027the Mitchell Freeway\u0027, \u0027the Kwinana Freeway\u0027, \u0027the Graham Farmer Freeway\u0027, \u0027the Tonkin Highway\u0027, \u0027Reid Highway\u0027, \u0027Roe Highway\u0027.",
